{"id":"mut","lemma":"Mut","pos":"noun","rank":1122,"glosses":["courage; bravery","mood; emotional state"],"ipa":"/muːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-Mut2.oga/De-Mut2.oga.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Mutes"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du den Mut dazu?","en":"Do you have the courage to do that?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"in addition to it"}]},{"text":"Ich habe deinen Mut nicht.","en":"I don't have your courage.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Er ist nicht völlig ohne Mut.","en":"He is not entirely without courage.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Was ihm fehlt, ist Mut.","en":"What he lacks is courage.","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"for there to be a lack…","l":"fehlen"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Wir sollten nicht den Mut verlieren.","en":"We shouldn't lose courage.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to lose"}]}]}